  "notes": "{弱|よわ}まる is an intransitive verb meaning to weaken or diminish.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{弱|よわ}める→弱める：02331_yowameru⟧ (transitive) - to weaken something\n\nVERB PAIR EXAMPLES:\n- ⟦{風|かぜ}→風：00641_kaze⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{弱|よわ}まった: The wind weakened (intransitive)\n- ⟦{音|おと}→音：00743_oto⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{弱|よわ}める→弱める：02331_yowameru⟧: to lower the sound (transitive)\n\nRELATED {弱|よわ} VERBS:\n- {弱|よわ}まる: to weaken (change/process)\n- ⟦{弱|よわ}める→弱める：02331_yowameru⟧: to weaken something (transitive)\n- ⟦{弱|よわ}る→弱る：02439_yowaru⟧: to become weak (resulting state)\n\nCOMMON SUBJECTS:\n- ⟦{風|かぜ}→風：00641_kaze⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{弱|よわ}まる: wind weakens\n- ⟦{勢|いきお}い→勢い：01782_ikioi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{弱|よわ}まる: momentum weakens\n- ⟦{痛|いた}み→痛み：01795_itami⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{弱|よわ}まる: pain subsides\n- ⟦{影響力|えいきょうりょく}→影響力：20040_eikyouryoku⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{弱|よわ}まる: influence weakens\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n- ⟦{強|つよ}まる→強まる：02295_tsuyomaru⟧: to strengthen, intensify",
